<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 7.8 points to 867 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 7.8 points to 867 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 7.8 points on Tuesday to 867, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the machinery index rising the most, up 26.5 points to 1,113.4.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
